<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Maple Cement first half net up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Maple Cement first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended</p>
<p>December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		     553 vs 527</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	78 vs 126</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	 75 vs  85</p>
<p>    Interim dividend	nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Maple Leaf Cement Factory Ltd. It manufactures cement. The company carried forward 80 million vs 90 million unappropriated profit to the balance sheet. There is no book closure as the company has not announced dividend.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
